{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>And He commanded.</b> The word of commandment with על is a negative commandment, as in עַל הָעֲרָבִים אֲצַוֶּה (Isaiah 5:6) — even though I have permitted to you the fruit of the trees of the garden, you shall not eat of the fruit of the tree of knowledge."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:43:34.814646219Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}